   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85245-32.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0032_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>dʾṭynwndʾṭ Y PWN yzdʾnʾp̄sṭʾn dʾlyk
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ẔNH BYRḤ mṭrˈ Y ŠNṬ 40 W YWM
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>zʾmdʾṭ dwlwckˈ PWN SWSYʾ-I
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>W ḤMRˈ-III Y dynpˈnkˈ Y
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>slm ŠG G-II ˈsp̄sṭˈ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>X glṭˈ ʿL dynpˈnkˈ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ʾwsṭʾndʾl
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ḤTYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0032_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Dādēnwindād ī pad Yazdān-ābestān dārīg
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ēn māh Mihr ī sāl 40 ud rõz
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>zāmyād dō-rōzag pad asp 1
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ud xar 3 ī Dēnbānag ī
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Sarm ǰaw g(rīw) 2 aspast
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>10 gird ō Dēnbānag
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>dād čak
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>ōstāndār
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0032_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Dādēnwindād, the manager in Yazdān-ābestān, is to give
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>this month Mihr (7th month) of the year 40 and day
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>Zāmyād (28th day) a two-day (ration) for one horse
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>and three donkeys of Dēnbānag of
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>Sarm 2 grīw of barley,
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>10 bundles of lucerne to Dēnbānag.
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7-9"/>The Ōstāndār sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>